    {
      "id": "claim_b3e653e6b31c48449486dd4942fd99ff",
      "statement": "RPC implementations across the backend and all gatekeeper workers are annotated with capnweb-validate's @validateRpc(), which auto-generates runtime validation from the interface's TypeScript signatures; the repo has a documented escape hatch, @skipRpcValidation(), used on GitHub's getVerifier().",
