    {
      "id": "claim_f48fa6a60dc946a9a57105c60d8db20b",
      "statement": "Expected RPC failures carry stable machine-readable codes built by codedErrorFamily (OPEN_GADGET_ERROR_CODES, AUTH_ERROR_CODES), where each code's message doubles as a classification fallback for older deployments; openGadget distinguishes WORKSPACE_NOT_FOUND from WORKSPACE_ACCESS_DENIED without revealing workspace metadata to unauthorized callers, and an access-denied error makes the server forget the stale shared-gadget listing entry.",
