    {
      "id": "claim_01a71b07bc144cbea84b6a99ddc29033",
      "statement": "The server detects loss of the workspace DO connection by disposing a notifyClosed callback passed to overseer.open() — disposed-but-not-called means lost, which aborts the browser WebSocket to trigger client reconnect; separately, AuthenticatedApi mints a fresh user-DO stub per request, and retryOnDoReset retries a replay-safe call once only through a thunk that mints a fresh stub, because a DO reset poisons captured stubs permanently.",
