      "id": "claim_eb3097acb31a4c0688538b808cb3c5df",
      "statement": "Gadget client code runs in a sandboxed iframe with no network access (CSP connect-src 'none'); the workshop injects the Cap'n Web bundle into the iframe as a doubly-nested data URL, and the iframe establishes its RPC session over a MessagePort handshake ('handshake' postMessage) using newMessagePortRpcSession.",
