    {
      "id": "claim_aa21a7d6bcdc4a3dbb2e32ac6a88186b",
      "statement": "GadgetClient.connectToGadget() returns the gadget's running facet as its server-side RPC capability, but facet stubs cannot cross RPC directly, so the overseer wraps the facet Fetcher in a Proxy masquerading as an RpcTarget (marked as a hack pending runtime support); the Overseer stub returned by openGadget is likewise a native cloudflare:workers RPC stub cast to a Cap'n Web stub with @ts-expect-error.",
