      "id": "claim_b03f01e27c844d6683600fb374db695b",
      "statement": "The client API is layered as PublicApi (unauthenticated: ping, getServerConfig, gatekeeper login, authenticate, login/createAccount, blueprint reads) and AuthenticatedApi (post-authentication: profile, models, gadget registry, openGadget, connected accounts, blueprints, getAdminApi), with PublicApi.startGatekeeperLogin returning a LoginAttempt stub whose disposal is the documented way to abandon a sign-in.",
